3. EVENTO: EL JUGADOR TOCA EL PORTAL
=========================================================
Esta función se ejecuta cuando el jugador toca
el tile llamado "portal".
Detecta cuando un sprite de tipo Player toca el portal.</comment><value name="HANDLER_DRAG_PARAM_sprite"><block type="argument_reporter_custom" id="3ufS]~Zn(V/)xsDKLN=8" deletable="false"><mutation typename="Sprite"></mutation><field name="VALUE">sprite22</field></block></value><value name="kind"><shadow type="spritekind" id="p7c`UtEkTj3NgPgUN~?V"><field name="MEMBER">Player</field></shadow></value><value name="tile"><shadow type="tileset_tile_picker" id="AfLtnDdtU}|TmefWr+]q"><field name="tile">assets.tile`portal`</field></shadow></value><value name="HANDLER_DRAG_PARAM_location"><block type="argument_reporter_custom" id="$yO,83yV@RN5w_2l[NC!" deletable="false"><mutation typename="tiles.Location"></mutation><field name="VALUE">location2</field></block></value><statement name="HANDLER"><block type="gameOver2" id="apYI);gpp56iJ!0;DX/("><comment pinned="false" h="80" w="160">Termina el juego indicando victoria.</comment><value name="win"><shadow type="toggleWinLose" id="xCTQ9f,]FR$^GN/joeV2"><field name="win">true</field></shadow></value><next><block type="game_setgameovereffect" id="@L;3x#Q?;yt3uJ_ckd|S"><field name="effect">effects.clouds</field><comment pinned="false" h="80" w="160">Muestra un efecto visual de nubes.</comment><value name="win"><shadow type="toggleWinLose" id="aiql+gwu!uE3~Kw`I;^g"><field name="win">true</field></shadow></value></block></next></block></statement></block><block type="pxt-on-start" id="lkKtj=*OZSIgS.A#gD]]" x="0" y="0"><statement name="HANDLER"><block type="gamesetbackgroundcolor" id="J1#dZO*4/0R#nQ6-b,#*"><comment pinned="false" h="80" w="160">Cambia el color de fondo de la escena.</comment><value name="color"><shadow type="colorindexpicker" id="xh516=x8KF)r#kOc#;NP"><field name="index">11</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="P/ZJDMTJD0gA$UVtFD|-"><field name="VAR" id="OE,RA?qVe](`7}Nn81vm">Rosado</field><comment pinned="false" h="80" w="160">Crea el sprite del jugador utilizando una imagen
formada por una cuadrícula de píxeles.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="o,T5!Pm-`4CXTK^]Q?{B"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="spritescreate" id="^@Q6l!)fm:y]xNoFu(#w"><value name="img"><shadow type="screen_image_picker" id="ZMhlAV@+M!so6SI9@i7M"><field name="img">img`
